      "options": {
        "content": "**Source:** `ControllerDiagnostics` rejection counts and execution gate reasons.\n\n**Discretization:** local curve \u2192 ladder \u2192 venue rules \u2192 capped.\n**Target-book risk:** frame gates (stale data, warmup) and net-delta collateral limits.\n**Rules gateway:** tick size, min qty, min notional.\n**Live gates:** observe-only, venue paused, stale global market, etc.",
